      <p>No. 114, 2018</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Customs Tariff Act 1995</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>[<i>Assented to 25 September 2018</i>]</p>
      <formula name="enacting">
        <p>The Parliament of Australia enacts:</p>
      </formula>
